  "title": "Korean-Inspired Grilled Chicken Thighs",
  "description": "Chicken thighs get bold Korean-inspired flavor from a long soak in a sweet, soy-based marinade in this easy barbecue recipe that can be used on any type of chicken.",
  "authors": [
    "funinthesun"
  ],
